<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He is tender and loving and patient with me,</l><l>While He cleanses my heart of its dross;</l><l>But “there’s no condemnation,” I know I am free,</l><l>For my sins were all borne on the cross.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I will cling to my Savior and never depart—</l><l>I will joyfully journey each day,</l><l>With a song on my lips and a song in my heart,</l><l>That my sins have been taken away.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
